# Verdict — RATIFY WITH LINE FIXES

Ratify Movement 1 subject to two local line fixes only: (1) chapter 5 must not settle the stillhound's sense as ordinary hearing before Movement 2 earns the discharge finding, and (2) chapter 7 must not print Pike's protected Thornwater-road document a second time. The movement's event architecture, Book 6 seam, calendar, standing defaults, protected exchanges, sale/reserve execution, names, and Movement 2 handoff otherwise stand. The required fixes affect `manuscript/chapter-05.md:235` and `manuscript/chapter-07.md:23` only.

## 1. Seam with Book 6

**Place, count and watch — PASS.** Book 6 leaves the five at the shelf on the second day past the Line, at the second camp and first fire, with Cael and Brom on first watch (`book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-60.md:55-63,193-203`). Book 7 opens on that same fire and count, with Cael and Brom completing the watch, Lira and Karis relieving them, and Seln correctly sleeping through as that night's changing fifth (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:3-17,37-57`). This preserves the two four-hour watches, two people per watch and changing fifth; no one sets Seln aside for judgment (`book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-60.md:61-79`; `manuscript/chapter-01.md:39-57`).

