**Fragments and knowledge — PASS.** Book 6 closes with nine confirmed fragments, the anomaly uncounted, Anchor idle, Blade partial and settling, and Shadow sealed (`book-06-the-compacts-hand/manuscript/chapter-60.md:205-231`). The new inventory keeps all five states: nine plus the uncounted anomaly, Anchor asking but unused, Blade partial, and Shadow sealed and drifting only as rent (`manuscript/chapter-01.md:29-35,239-269`; `manuscript/chapter-04.md:83-105`). The five retain the mechanism; nobody new learns it, and Teague cannot even classify Cael (`manuscript/chapter-07.md:345-353`).

