+- Speaker attribution remains clear through the road-rule discussion, Pike's board procedure, the woman-captain correction, and the Teague cutaway. The repaired captain passage improves orientation by making the objection the entrance beat and delaying the crew reveal until after proof.
+- Referents pass. “The last line” now names Cael's own deployment count; “four lines” names ledger lines; the 110-yard figure carries its measuring provenance; “eight roads” is explicitly five plus three.
